{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "80f02dff453c5e3ae9c761ce339aa59b2fe62a4543cec8991696475c30b5e001", "ja": "（ジュリアの新しい衣装が届いた。可愛さをベースに、\nジュリアらしいカッコよさもプラスしている）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的新衣服送到了。在可爱的基础上，还加入了茱莉亚风格的帅气。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "7aa4e77cef9c0e21b552ffbe43340f60d530f7bf00b77232815bd344fa38e74e", "ja": "うん、なかなかいい感じだな。\nまさしく、ロックなアイドルにピッタリだ！", "zh": "嗯，感觉相当不错啊。\n简直太适合摇滚偶像了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "e48d0b24a25fa7b0e4988002384a03bbebacfd6402564ba5d37433f678d2b231", "ja": "カッコよさはもちろん、カワイさも忘れてない。\n絶妙なバランスだ、気に入ったよ♪", "zh": "帅气自不必说，可爱也没有忘记。这个绝妙的平衡，我喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1003_p", "source_sha256": "421e1b54a98bc235b418f82c0073ad69c079ccc7573027951a3bb5a498579115", "ja": "それはよかった。ロックなカッコよさもだけど、\n今回は少しだけ、可愛さと甘さもお願いしたんだ。", "zh": "那就好。这次不光要有摇滚风的帅气，\n我还特意加入了一点可爱和甜美的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "9631a97abe1a0ae5723f42649b845b1469ce0e8d2522809f3e12cf8d483397c3", "ja": "いいんじゃないか。\n一応、アイドルが着る衣装だからな。", "zh": "挺不错的嘛。\n毕竟再怎么说，也是偶像要穿的服装啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "804eb962baf621e5e63fbad5d0ff14e0fa3ae197fc795f150e990d68a8532f0c", "ja": "かと言って、カワイすぎてもアレだけど……。\nまあ、こういう感じなら嫌いじゃない。", "zh": "话虽如此，太可爱了也有点那个……  \n不过，这种感觉我倒是不讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "baae65d132c6985eb9af5acec854176eb7f5fb53f219fa6c46daa67bcb63471e", "ja": "あたしらしさをたくさん詰め込んだ……\nまさしく、あたしのための衣装って感じがするよ。", "zh": "满满融入了我的风格……\n简直就像是专门为我设计的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7bb2529df7119a68736d3e95325938e64afca6b9c31c428fecae520ec272806a", "ja": "そうだな。どれがひとつ欠けても、\nそれはジュリアじゃないから。そこは意識してるよ。", "zh": "没错。哪一个有所缺失，都不再是茱莉亚了。我一直很注意这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "0cce8a54bcbe86a800151fa34ec21799c812865e54fee8c685e9b5f684c60006", "ja": "サンキュー。ふふっ。自分だけの衣装ってのは、\nなんか特別感があって、嬉しいもんだな。", "zh": "谢啦。呵呵。只属于自己的服装，总觉得特别有感觉，真让人开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "9f9c34a0c9fff397f8fd60f0065b135fe4cdb67a68ce00f2453aaf339788d979", "ja": "この先、何回もコイツを着て、\nステージに立つんだと思うと……なんか戦友みたいだ。", "zh": "想到今后还要穿着它无数次站上舞台……感觉它就像战友一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d7228c3f1266582f51e513ad64f0532d08db0f96dcabacc8ffd2c4a6cb6c165d", "ja": "ああ。ギターとロックみたいに、この衣装が\nジュリアに欠かせない物になるかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊。就像吉他之于摇滚一样，这套服装或许会成为茱莉亚不可或缺的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "2484e1ed6de4a469077139fbd820164615cda67a55a3eec77465850d7e03ca7f", "ja": "何言ってんだ。「かも」じゃなくて、\nあたしに欠かせない物にするんだよ。", "zh": "说什么呢。“也许”什么的，这要成为我不可或缺的东西才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "34e4c2b66cc38e6c93c8c58c2fcf4449a2673c2e680a093302e00b3469a2e2d4", "ja": "あんたには感謝してるんだ。\nだからできるだけ、期待には応えたい。", "zh": "我是很感谢你的。\n所以只要能做到，我就想尽量回应你的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5e6b586a41428fac647d3ce306e7f893c8bdf54031bbb519ad22919f74e540bd", "ja": "十分、応えてもらってるよ。ジュリアは、将来の\nイメージがしっかりしてるから、俺も安心してるんだ。", "zh": "你已经充分回应我的期待了。因为茱莉亚对未来的规划很明确，所以我也很放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "d0120e871807bcd75426b0caf95e28661565a1878c3e394e3f652e1f0bf9e9eb", "ja": "すごい信頼感……。でも、どうだろうな？\nちゃんと描いた未来になってるかっていうと……。", "zh": "好强的信赖感……不过，谁知道呢？\n要说是否真的变成了我描绘的未来…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bb5c04e7a6060274b3ed80f7007352d5ad979f7889de5841b0e8eca2fe8c6e13", "ja": "今はそれでいいんじゃないか？　先は長いんだ。\n数年後には、また違う姿になってるかもしれないし。", "zh": "现在这样不也挺好吗？来日方长嘛。\n几年后，说不定又会变成另一副模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "1865b0868e6b25928f447e21cba9916e85d608a88c57c045a24e5713e551b7f5", "ja": "……確かに。\nもしかしたら、アイドルしてなかったりするかもな？", "zh": "……确实。\n说不定到那时，已经不当偶像了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "f1707f499c192d44ef19e5a80ce032980e6451c78f86f408662ac008e4b4aa90", "ja": "ははっ、冗談。どこにいても、あたしのやることは\n変わらない。ロックなアイドルとして進み続けるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，开玩笑的。无论身在何处，我要做的事都不会改变。作为摇滚偶像，我会继续前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6fbf77a5c8a33bfb1628ce8a8e4f7544be99989dd0320032a9404748de0cb629", "ja": "ジュリア……。\nこれから先、どんな姿を見せてくれるのか楽しみだな！", "zh": "茱莉亚……真期待你今后会展现出怎样的模样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0524_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "cacaf8d2987fc4f0609a474daaac5b088e34a103a7dc2419474e0599717c9a50", "ja": "おいおい、ひと事みたいに……。\nこれでも頼りにしてるんだ。期待してるぜ、相棒♪", "zh": "喂喂，说得就像事不关己一样……我可是很依赖你的。期待你的表现，搭档♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
